1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,186
Look at the dot.

2
00:00:01,186 --> 00:00:03,257
Now jump your eyes to the clock.

3
00:00:04,557 --> 00:00:06,469
That first tick seemed to hang.

4
00:00:06,469 --> 00:00:07,764
The video didn't lag.

5
00:00:08,264 --> 00:00:12,020
While your eyes jump, your brain switches off the blurry view.

6
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:16,670
Then it fills the gap with the clock, as if you'd been looking all along.

7
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:19,845
That borrowed time lands on the first tick.

8
00:00:19,845 --> 00:00:22,272
It can feel up to half a second longer.

9
00:00:22,772 --> 00:00:25,481
And your eyes jump about three times a second.

10
00:00:25,981 --> 00:00:27,298
Did your clock freeze?
